        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 76.83,
          "en": "Now, what can you do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 81.06,
          "en": "if ChatGPT gives you code that does not work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.06,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "Well, you can basically do what we already did before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "when I explained what you can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 88.92,
          "en": "if you can't execute the program.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.92,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "So when I, for example, described",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 95.49000000000001,
          "en": "that you might get this no such file or directory error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.49000000000001,
          "end": 98.31,
          "en": "You report errors or missing features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.31,
          "end": 102.57,
          "en": "to ChatGPT so that it helps you fix them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.57,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "And then you basically have this iterative process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "where you then again try executing the program",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 111.36,
          "en": "and if it works, you're happy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 114.78,
          "en": "If it does not work, you again report those errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.78,
          "end": 117.78,
          "en": "to ChatGPT and you keep on going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 122.37,
          "en": "through that process until you have the working program.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.37,
          "end": 127.37,
          "en": "For example here, I will remove this one import line here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.92,
          "end": 132.69,
          "en": "which for me was in line three, which will break this code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.69,
          "end": 136.74,
          "en": "If I now do take all these files and re-add them right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "into demofiles, and I get rid of these subfolders again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 145.5,
          "en": "and I now try to execute this program again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 147.24,
          "en": "if I enter demofiles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.24,
          "end": 151.32,
          "en": "I will now actually get an error because I broke the code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.32,
          "end": 154.14,
          "en": "Now, of course, typically, you would not break your code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.14,
          "end": 157.11,
          "en": "but ChatGPT could have generated code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.11,
          "end": 158.73,
          "en": "that contains an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 160.98,
          "en": "So here I just broke it to simulate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.98,
          "end": 163.503,
          "en": "that you got code with an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.43,
          "end": 166.74,
          "en": "In that case, it's always a good idea to take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.74,
          "end": 171,
          "en": "at the output and to then maybe take the entire output,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 174.12,
          "en": "or if you're able to identify the parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.12,
          "end": 175.89,
          "en": "that seem most important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.89,
          "end": 178.82999999999998,
          "en": "to just copy and paste those parts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.82999999999998,
          "end": 181.33,
          "en": "So here maybe this line of code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.19,
          "end": 184.83,
          "en": "or this line of error output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.83,
          "end": 188.79,
          "en": "And you would then again, as mentioned, go back to ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.79,
          "end": 193.79,
          "en": "and let it know about this error, for example, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.79,
          "end": 197.19,
          "en": "Now, here in this case, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.19,
          "end": 200.97,
          "en": "the problem is that ChatGPT, of course, in theory,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.97,
          "end": 204.72,
          "en": "has the correct code in its memory, but nonetheless,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.72,
          "end": 207.9,
          "en": "it understands that the problem seems to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.9,
          "end": 211.14,
          "en": "that the file type module seems to be missing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.14,
          "end": 213.06,
          "en": "has not been imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.06,
          "end": 216.63,
          "en": "So therefore, it basically ignores that in theory",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.63,
          "end": 218.97,
          "en": "it gave me correct code earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.97,
          "end": 221.97,
          "en": "and instead, it focuses on my error description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 224.64,
          "en": "and gives me an updated code snippet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 229.29,
          "en": "that now again contains this import, which I deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.29,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "So therefore, now if I would take this entire code snippet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 235.05,
          "en": "or in my case, since I know what I broke,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.05,
          "end": 240.05,
          "en": "just this import statement here again, I can update my code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 240.78,
          "end": 245.78,
          "en": "and if I would now try to run it again, it would work again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 246.09,
          "end": 249.06,
          "en": "So it's typically this iterative process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.06,
          "end": 250.44,
          "en": "through which you go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 250.44,
          "end": 254.28,
          "en": "if you're building programs with ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.28,
          "end": 257.4,
          "en": "and especially if you have no development experience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.4,
          "end": 260.49,
          "en": "you will, of course, typically have to ask a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 265.05,
          "en": "of questions and report a lot of errors because, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.05,
          "end": 267.6,
          "en": "you got no experience with such things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 267.6,
          "end": 271.56,
          "en": "So naturally, you need more help from ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 271.56,
          "end": 274.05,
          "en": "But at least for basic tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 274.05,
          "end": 276.54,
          "en": "and basic programs like this one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 276.54,
          "end": 281.19,
          "en": "ChatGPT also tends to be able to provide great support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 281.19,
          "end": 283.413,
          "en": "and to generate decent code.",
          "zh": ""
